Bigger monsters can be a problem, but the way I get around it is
wait until a dwarf comes along and knocks out all the walls around
the temple, then stand just outside the temple on the opposite side
to the monster.  As soon as they step into the temple, I run in, 
lure them onto the altar and knock 'em off with Mjolly or Excal or
whatever handy-dandy monster knocker you've got.  This works fine
as long as you don't let a whole horde of monsters in at once 
because you can take your time knocking off the one you have and
then rest up a bit before luring in the next one.
I suppose you don't really need to have the walls all knocked out,
but it makes it easier to get them onto the altar without having to
take too severe a beating luring them over.
 
Hope this helps you out.
 
